# Real tenant records stay local — org ids and contacts are business-sensitive in a
# public repo (files contain no secrets either way; tokens live in the keychain and are
# only *referenced* from these files).
# LEGACY location: tenant.sh now keeps the registry off the checkout, in
# $HOME/.bolyra/tenants-<env> (E2). These stay ignored so a checkout that still holds
# records from before the move (bring them over with `tenant.sh migrate --from`) can never
# commit them.
tenants/
# every HOSTED_VERIFY_ENV registry directory, not just staging
tenants-*/
partners/
# Local audit exports
*.jsonl
